  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regleringsram f&#xF6;r immateriella r&#xE4;ttigheter och patent f&#xF6;r forskningspraxis</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regulatory framework on intellectual property and patents for research practices</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konsulten kommer att definiera villkoren f&#xF6;r att fastst&#xE4;lla immateriella r&#xE4;ttigheter och anv&#xE4;ndning av patent f&#xF6;r forsknings&#xE4;ndam&#xE5;l f&#xF6;r bolivianska universitet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The consultancy will define the conditions to establish intellectual property rights and the use of patents for research purposes for Bolivian universities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develope a proposal for institutional policies for the protection of intellectual property at the universities of La Paz (UMSA) and Cochabamba (UMSS), including regulations, manuals and procedures for the operationalization of the intellectual property policy in both universities.</narrative>
  </description>
